---
import { SITE } from "../lib/site.ts";
---

<footer class="mt-32 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-cream/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="display text-[44px] md:text-[64px] leading-[0.95]">
          Verdeo
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[42ch] text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Velas, difusores, jabones y textiles hechos a mano con materias primas
          nobles. Cuidamos cada detalle, desde la fragancia hasta el packaging.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={SITE.redes.instagram}
            aria-label="Instagram de Verdeo"
            class="w-10 h-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--color-hairline)] hover:border-forest hover:text-forest transition-colors duration-300"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"></rect>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle>
              <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.8" fill="currentColor"></circle>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href={SITE.redes.facebook}
            aria-label="Facebook de Verdeo"
            class="w-10 h-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--color-hairline)] hover:border-forest hover:text-forest transition-colors duration-300"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M13 22v-8h2.7l.4-3H13V9c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5H16V5c-.3 0-1.2-.1-2.3-.1-2.3 0-3.7 1.4-3.7 3.9V11H7.5v3H10v8h3z"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Tienda</div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/productos" class="hover:text-forest transition-colors">Catálogo</a></li>
          <li><a href="/productos?cat=velas" class="hover:text-forest transition-colors">Velas</a></li>
          <li><a href="/productos?cat=difusores" class="hover:text-forest transition-colors">Difusores</a></li>
          <li><a href="/productos?cat=jabones" class="hover:text-forest transition-colors">Jabones</a></li>
          <li><a href="/productos?cat=textiles" class="hover:text-forest transition-colors">Textiles</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Contacto</div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="hover:text-forest transition-colors">{SITE.email}</a>
          </li>
          <li class="text-muted">{SITE.telefono}</li>
          <li class="text-muted mt-2">Lunes a sábados · 10 a 19 h</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 text-xs text-muted-soft leading-relaxed max-w-[34ch]">
          Envíos a todo el país. Despachamos en 48 h hábiles desde CABA.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="hairline mt-14" />
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-3 mt-6 text-xs text-muted-soft">
      <div>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Verdeo Tienda · Todos los derechos reservados.</div>
      <div>Hecho con cuidado en Buenos Aires.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
